config.h contains libxml2's compilation configuration for Linux. It was generated by executing "./configure --with-lzma=no" in the libxml2's main directory.
xmlversion.h was generated by executing "cscript configure.js compiler=msvc prefix=c:\libxml ftp=no http=no html=no iconv=no xml_debug=no" in libxml2's "win32" directory.  However, it can also be generated by the aforementioned Linux configure command.
